WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Close-up of Squall's face in profile, scar visible, against a hazy void.

2
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Squall staggers alone across a vast barren desert under a swirling grey sky.

3
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
He stumbles onward, a tiny figure against the desolate landscape. Time warps above.

4
00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:00.000
The endless desert stretches in every direction. Squall presses forward, exhausted.

5
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:15.000
He falls to his knees. The distorted sky churns with impossible shapes.

6
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Rinoa stands with her back to the camera, gazing up at a dark teal sky, waiting.

7
00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:45.000
Visions flicker. Squall reaches the flower field at sunset, petals drifting around him.

8
00:01:50.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Rinoa stands among the flowers. Squall approaches her in the golden light.

9
00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:20.000
Time-distorted flashbacks. Faces blur and overlap with the orphanage in fragments.

10
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:40.000
A young Edea appears amid shimmering distortions, receiving sorceress power.

11
00:02:50.000 --> 00:03:00.000
Ghostly stone archways shift and dissolve. The orphanage phases through time.

12
00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:25.000
Memories fracture. Children, flowers, and architecture warp together.

13
00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:45.000
The visions clear. Light floods the screen, washing everything white.

14
00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:40.000
A single white feather drifts gently against a pure white sky.
